From bda75c2af6e5836d08f0ac72710334897cac10d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Downstream Patch Queue <downstream@localhost>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 12:21:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 29/29] Describe the price table as coming from the service

The daily price card no longer links to the upstream price file, and its copy
now says the table comes from the Agent Speed price service (public mirrors
when it is unreachable) and that only a download happens. Drops the unused
prices.viewSource string, the macOS and Windows source-page URLs, the Windows
view-source command and the trailing-icon label style.
